apps/desktop/build/preview-slides.png

# The installer's animation: thirty megabytes of true-colour frames,
# generated by apps/desktop/build/art/make-installer-art.py at build
# time. NSIS compresses it to about 0.9 MB (measured: makensis with
# SetCompressor lzma, which is what electron-builder uses). An earlier
# note here said 0.2 MB; that was an estimate from the flat-palette draft,
# before the art had blur and gradients in it.
apps/desktop/build/slides.avi
